# The bus shelter: a teal roof on iron posts, a glass back with a poster, a
# slatted bench inside. Three tiles wide, open to the street. The poster is a
# placeholder, a glowing O roundel over two lines of teal type: the name is
# too wide to read on it, and Oddboro has no mark yet. The home spot is the
# middle tile under the roof, which is where staff arrive in the morning and
# where they wait for the bus home. zbias -1 so whoever stands there paints
# over the shelter.
sprite street-bus-shelter
size 48 48
layer object
footprint 3 1
origin 0 32
zbias -1
tag shelter street stop
spot stop 1 0 up home stand
light 24 8 36 #ffd27a 0.5

frame default
